                                "sense_id": "94a30c23-e07a-3566-8ae1-e59e52e0f7fc",
                                "text": "All at once, an epiphany of sorts, his wangtooth roving through the binding caught upon a manuscript fragment which to all appearances is the missing conclusion of the Hous."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb979129-55bc-4463-88a0-4894201f9121",
                                "sense_id": "94a30c23-e07a-3566-8ae1-e59e52e0f7fc",
                                "text": "Then he asked leave a third time, and the youth, knowing that, if the Khalif assented yet once more, it would be the signal of his death, laughed till his wang-teeth appeared; […]"
                            }
